{"created": "2026-08-31T07:32:42.512152+00:00", "modified": "2026-09-01T22:02:15.045064+00:00", "id": 22191728, "conceptrecid": "22191727", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.22191728", "conceptdoi": "10.5281/zenodo.22191727", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.22191728", "metadata": {"title": "Learning Without Remembering: Habituation in Weights and a Calibrated Self-Model in a Minimal Embodied Agent", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.22191728", "publication_date": "2026-08-31", "description": "<p>We present a minimal embodied agent that runs without vision or audition, on body channels only: an action-conditioned body predictor, a homeostatic drive (E,C,U,S), episodic memory, and a meta-cognitive module Phi that predicts its own prediction error. A pre-registered 30-seed study (grid world, 13-&gt;128-&gt;128-&gt;6, +/-5 teleport) tested whether this loop can detect violations of its sensorimotor contingencies, habituate by updating its model, and retain that update in weights rather than in explicit memory. It can, but coarsely. Detection was reliable (z=20.6, 95% CI [16.0, 25.5]). Habituation cut surprise by 86% (d=3.5). The trace lived in the weight delta (post/pre ratio 0.02; restoring pre-habituation weights restores surprise z=67.5, freezing weights prevents habituation). The meta-cognitive module Phi (scalar MSE to |epsilon|) was calibrated (r=0.701) and generalized out of distribution (r_cross=0.730); in an isolated causal battery it halved time in an unreliable zone when coupled to action (15.0% vs 28.1%, d=-1.61), while the equivalent effect in the integrated organism is reproducible with a random attention gate, a confound we flag rather than hide. One pre-registered control failed and is reported in full: stimulus generalization (C3) shows habituation to a +5 teleport transfers to -5 (z 1.1 vs 0.9), i.e. learning of displacement magnitude, not the vector &mdash; learning without distinguishing. The continuous-physics organism (13-&gt;64-&gt;6, +2 teleport, active attention) reproduces the closed-loop integration over 30,000 steps.</p>\n<p>This is version v0.12. The complete system runs on a MacBook Pro (M4 Pro, Apple silicon) with no discrete GPU. Raw logs and pre-registration notes are available from the author upon request.</p>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Valerio Porras, Adri\u00e1n", "affiliation": "Independent Researcher, San Jos\u00e9, Costa Rica", "orcid": "0009-0003-8445-2214"}], "keywords": ["embodied cognition", "habituation", "metacognition", "homeostatic reinforcement learning", "sensorimotor contingencies"], "version": "v0.12", "language": "eng", "custom": {"code:programmingLanguage": [{"id": "python", "title": {"en": "Python"}}]}, "resource_type": {"title": "Preprint", "type": "publication", "subtype": "preprint"}, "license": {"id": "cc-by-4.0"}, "relations": {"version": [{"index": 0, "is_last": true, "parent": {"pid_type": "recid", "pid_value": "22191727"}}]}}, "title": "Learning Without Remembering: Habituation in Weights and a Calibrated Self-Model in a Minimal Embodied Agent", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22191728", "self_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/22191728", "preview_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/22191728?preview=1", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.22191728", "self_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.22191728", "self_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.22191728", "reserve_doi": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22191728/draft/pids/doi", "parent": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22191727", "parent_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/22191727", "parent_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.22191727", "parent_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.22191727", "self_iiif_manifest": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:22191728/manifest", "self_iiif_sequence": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:22191728/sequence/default", "files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22191728/files", "media_files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22191728/media-files", "thumbnails": {"10": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:22191728:Learning_Without_Remembering_v0.12.pdf/full/%5E10,/0/default.jpg", "50": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:22191728:Learning_Without_Remembering_v0.12.pdf/full/%5E50,/0/default.jpg", "100": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:22191728:Learning_Without_Remembering_v0.12.pdf/full/%5E100,/0/default.jpg", "250": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:22191728:Learning_Without_Remembering_v0.12.pdf/full/%5E250,/0/default.jpg", "750": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:22191728:Learning_Without_Remembering_v0.12.pdf/full/%5E750,/0/default.jpg", "1200": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:22191728:Learning_Without_Remembering_v0.12.pdf/full/%5E1200,/0/default.jpg"}, "latest": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22191728/versions/latest", "latest_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/22191728/latest", "versions": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22191728/versions", "draft": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22191728/draft", "access_links": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22191728/access/links", "access_grants": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22191728/access/grants", "access_users": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22191728/access/users", "access_request": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22191728/access/request", "access": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22191728/access", "communities": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22191728/communities", "communities-suggestions": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22191728/communities-suggestions", "request_deletion": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22191728/request-deletion", "file_modification": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22191728/file-modification", "quota_increase": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22191728/quota-increase", "requests": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22191728/requests"}, "updated": "2026-09-01T22:02:15.045064+00:00", "recid": "22191728", "revision": 10, "files": [{"id": "83b58278-9c38-44db-bed7-8850d4cceab1", "key": "LICENSE", "size": 1376, "ch